// Title: Tor Client/Browser Execution
// Rule ID: 62f7c9bf-9135-49b2-8aeb-1e54a6ecc13c
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1090.003
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_browsers_tor_execution.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
